#@DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress = https://localhost:7008
@DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress = https://data-exchange-conversion-service.azurewebsites.net
# A job is addressed by the collection ID and the exchange URN, each its own path segment, so both
# go in exactly as they appear in ACC — no encoding step in between.
@collectionId = b.12345678-abcd-1234-abcd-1234567890ab
@exchangeUrn = urn:adsk.wipprod:dm.lineage:1-WkzyuRRv-v4ANzo1Kz1g
@AccessToken = ...

### Start conversion job
POST {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Get conversion job status
GET {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Get conversion job artifact
GET {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}/artifacts/fe8020e9-b2d3-3bac-b5c5-d0ae1d55a36a.obj
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: model/obj

### Get conversion job artifact
GET {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}/artifacts/b628c5eb-dfb3-3e8b-8f07-c6b4ffc554c4.glb
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Get conversion job artifact
GET {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}/artifacts/b628c5eb-dfb3-3e8b-8f07-c6b4ffc554c4.usdz
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Get conversion job log
GET {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}/log
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Delete conversion job
DELETE {{DataExchangeViewingService_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/{{collectionId}}/{{exchangeUrn}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
